msgctxt "64"
msgid "That's far enough! Get away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "But what about our wedding? We were gonna get married, Natsumi-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Sorry for keepin' you waiting, Akiho-san. I'll handle this scumball for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I don't get it! I shower you with affection, give you gifts every day of "
"the week, even keep your bank account in the green... and this is what I "
"get!? I'm out of here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Be careful out here, Akiho-san. Who knows what kinda nutjobs you might run "
"into these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"You're right. And... thanks. I don't think I'll run into any more trouble, "
"but I'll give you another call if I do. Bye!"
msgstr ""

